A '''Cameraman''' (Japanese: '''カメラマン''' ''Cameraman'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that first debuted in the [[Generation IV]] games. They are men working as television cameramen.

Cameramen are the male counterparts of {{tc|Reporter}}s. When paired with Reporters in [[Double Battle]]s, they are called {{tc|Interviewers}}. In [[Pokémon Sword and Shield]], they appear exclusively as a part of this Trainer class, except in the {{gal|Battle Tower}}.

They specialize in {{type|Electric}} Pokémon.

